WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Standing heavy punch starts the corner confirm.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.450
OD Adamant Flame and its forward-punch follow-up launch Ryu.

3
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.950
Crouching heavy punch continues the corner juggle.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.850
Light Gou Hadoken connects before the Super cancel.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:08.550
Akuma activates Level 1 from the fireball.

6
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.200
Ryu falls at the end of Level 1.
